WEBVTT

00:01:28.738 --> 00:01:31.538
Organizations, including the one
that I work with,

00:01:31.578 --> 00:01:35.038
shifted to remote working
and I was able to continue working.

00:01:35.078 --> 00:01:38.158
Some schools figured out
how to deliver online classes,

00:01:38.178 --> 00:01:41.478
and my children only had three weeks
of interruption to their learning

00:01:41.498 --> 00:01:43.498
before they were back in class online.

00:01:43.938 --> 00:01:48.138
Granted, they were in these classes
wearing a school shirt and a school tie

00:01:48.158 --> 00:01:49.878
with pajama bottoms,

00:01:49.898 --> 00:01:51.598
but I couldn't do anything about it

00:01:51.598 --> 00:01:53.758
because I was doing
pretty much the same thing

00:01:53.778 --> 00:01:55.098
in my Zoom meetings.

00:01:55.638 --> 00:01:57.978
Unfortunately, this picture
that I've painted

00:01:57.998 --> 00:01:59.898
was not the same for everyone.